Package: harbour-seaprint
Version: @VERSION@
Section: user/office
Priority: optional
Architecture: armel
Depends: libqt4-declarative, libqt4-network, libqt4-gui, libqt4-dbus, libqt4-svg, qt-components, libcurl3, libglib2.0-0, libpoppler-glib4, libcairo2, libjpeg62
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/attah/harbour-seaprint
Description: Print over the network, without a computer
 SeaPrint sends a document straight to a printer on the same Wi-Fi, over IPP:
 no driver, no PC, no cloud. It finds printers by itself, asks each one what
 it can do, and converts the file to a format that printer takes -- PDF,
 PostScript, PWG raster, URF, JPEG or PNG.
 .
 MeeGo Harmattan edition of the Sailfish OS app by attah.
Maemo-Display-Name: SeaPrint
XB-Maemo-Icon-26:
@ICON@
